# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install `qiskit-ibm-runtime` {#install-qiskit-ibm-runtime}"
msgstr "تثبيت `qiskit-ibm-runtime` {#install-qiskit-ibm-runtime}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to install `qiskit-ibm-runtime`:\n"
msgstr "اتبع هذه الخطوات لتثبيت `qiskit-ibm-runtime`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` repository.\n"
msgstr "انسخ مستودع `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (clone).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change to the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` directory.\n"
msgstr "انتقل إلى مجلد `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install `qiskit-runtime`. We recommend using a [virtual environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr "ثبِّت `qiskit-runtime`. ننصحك باستخدام [بيئة افتراضية](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) حتى لا تلوِّث تثبيت بايثون العام عندك.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Standard install**:\n"
msgstr "**التثبيت العادي**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Editable mode**: In this mode, you don't need to reinstall Qiskit when there are code changes to the project.\n"
msgstr "**وضع التحرير (Editable mode)**: في هذا الوضع ما تحتاج تعيد تثبيت Qiskit عند حدوث تغييرات في كود المشروع.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    In editable mode, the compiled extensions are built in _debug mode_ without optimizations.\n"
msgstr "    في وضع التحرير، تُبنى الامتدادات المترجمة في _وضع التصحيح (debug mode)_ بدون تحسينات.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "(Optional) If you want to run tests or linting checks, install the developer requirements. We recommend using a [virtual environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr "(اختياري) إذا بغيت تشغِّل الاختبارات أو فحوصات التدقيق (linting)، ثبِّت متطلبات المطوّرين. ننصحك باستخدام [بيئة افتراضية](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) حتى لا تلوِّث تثبيت بايثون العام عندك.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "الخطوات التالية {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Read the [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) to contribute to `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"توصيات\">\n"
"  - اقرأ [إرشادات المساهمة](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) للمساهمة في `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [ثبِّت Qiskit SDK من المصدر](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [شغِّل برنامجك الأول](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - جرِّب درسًا تعليميًا، مثل [خوارزمية Grover](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
